{"4999200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "OSCILLARIS", "steam_appid": 4999200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4999200/extras/231e0ab776a832ec6ae3fa6903025599.poster.avif?t=1785351783\" width=1046 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4999200/extras/231e0ab776a832ec6ae3fa6903025599.webm?t=1785351783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4999200/extras/231e0ab776a832ec6ae3fa6903025599.mp4?t=1785351783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OSCILLARIS is a text-command RPG that takes place inside of an oscilloscope.</strong> Type your way through its wireframe streets, talk to programs who live there, use your words to defeat rouge signals! The game wanted to be found, now its up to you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SOMETHING WAS HERE BEFORE YOU</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OSCILLARIS is built on the ruins of its predecessor. It's programs don't remember what came before, but the world does. If you know where to look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4999200/extras/a6c49b9e34647da48a3f388556aa0234.poster.avif?t=1785351783\" width=1044 height=578 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4999200/extras/a6c49b9e34647da48a3f388556aa0234.webm?t=1785351783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4999200/extras/a6c49b9e34647da48a3f388556aa0234.mp4?t=1785351783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Type</strong> commands to walk, examine and interact with the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> the wireframe world and find secrets within it's glowing vector lines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet</strong> programs with their own personalities and story to unfold</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive</strong> incoming signals with their own agendas with your spelling skills and letter play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover</strong> fragments of a past that remembers more about you than yourself</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NOT EVERY SIGNAL IS FRIENDLY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An echo remains from the past, running somewhere in the code. Explore the BOOT sector, <i>but don't go looking for something you won't want to find.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4999200/extras/172b57703341abb00cff669cbee0448d.poster.avif?t=1785351783\" width=1038 height=580 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4999200/extras/172b57703341abb00cff669cbee0448d.webm?t=1785351783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4999200/extras/172b57703341abb00cff669cbee0448d.mp4?t=1785351783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4999200/extras/231e0ab776a832ec6ae3fa6903025599.poster.avif?t=1785351783\" width=1046 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4999200/extras/231e0ab776a832ec6ae3fa6903025599.webm?t=1785351783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4999200/extras/231e0ab776a832ec6ae3fa6903025599.mp4?t=1785351783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OSCILLARIS is a text-command RPG that takes place inside of an oscilloscope.</strong> Type your way through its wireframe streets, talk to programs who live there, use your words to defeat rouge signals! The game wanted to be found, now its up to you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SOMETHING WAS HERE BEFORE YOU</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OSCILLARIS is built on the ruins of its predecessor. It's programs don't remember what came before, but the world does. If you know where to look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4999200/extras/a6c49b9e34647da48a3f388556aa0234.poster.avif?t=1785351783\" width=1044 height=578 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4999200/extras/a6c49b9e34647da48a3f388556aa0234.webm?t=1785351783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4999200/extras/a6c49b9e34647da48a3f388556aa0234.mp4?t=1785351783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Type</strong> commands to walk, examine and interact with the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> the wireframe world and find secrets within it's glowing vector lines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet</strong> programs with their own personalities and story to unfold</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive</strong> incoming signals with their own agendas with your spelling skills and letter play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover</strong> fragments of a past that remembers more about you than yourself</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NOT EVERY SIGNAL IS FRIENDLY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An echo remains from the past, running somewhere in the code. Explore the BOOT sector, <i>but don't go looking for something you won't want to find.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4999200/extras/172b57703341abb00cff669cbee0448d.poster.avif?t=1785351783\" width=1038 height=580 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4999200/extras/172b57703341abb00cff669cbee0448d.webm?t=1785351783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4999200/extras/172b57703341abb00cff669cbee0448d.mp4?t=1785351783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck!</p>", "short_description": "A text-command RPG drawn in glowing vector lines across a vivacious oscilloscope. Type to explore, use words to defend yourself, and don't trust every signal you hear. No matter how convincing.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Danish, Dutch, Finnish, Japanese, Korean, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Swedish, Turkish, Ukrainian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4999200/43603d4fe47bdf47f7a7d72b551793971c046d3b/header.jpg?t=1785351783", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4999200/41b5f6e150345c64fd978694297511aa1a2d9ac8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785351783", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4999200/41b5f6e150345c64fd978694297511aa1a2d9